   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi Greg, hi listfolk,\r<br>\r<br>This is a bit of a tricky issue. The variance calculation code in the \r<br>dsm.var.* functions needs to use the summary output from the detection \r<br>function to get include the detection function uncertainty in the \r<br>estimate of variance. Without having constructed the detection function \r<br>in mrds/Distance, it&#39;s quite difficult to get that object working correctly.\r<br>\r<br>If you are able to send me some more details on your situation we can \r<br>see if there&#39;s a simple solution and then report back to the list.\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>All the best,\r<br>--dave\r<br>"
    ],
